  "home\\home": {
    "html": "\r\n<main class=\"container mt-4\">\r\n    <section class=\"hero-section text-center text-light\">\r\n        <div class=\"row g-4 align-items-center\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                <h1 class=\"white-text\">欢迎来到</h1>\r\n                <h2 class=\"white-text display-4\">龙华*高级中学</h2>\r\n                <h2 class=\"white-text display-5 fw-light\">校园墙</h2>\r\n                <span class=\"white-text lead d-block\">本站已运行\r\n                    <span id=\"run-day\" class=\"fw-bold text-warning\">0</span>天\r\n                    <span id=\"run-hour\" class=\"fw-bold text-warning\">0</span>小时\r\n                    <span id=\"run-min\" class=\"fw-bold text-warning\">0</span>分钟\r\n                    <span id=\"run-sec\" class=\"fw-bold text-warning\">0</span>秒\r\n                </span>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 d-flex flex-column align-items-center\">\r\n                <a href=\"/wall\" class=\"white btn btn-primary me-2 mb-2\" style=\"background-color: #6A0DAD; border-color: #6A0DAD;box-shadow: #6a0dad91;\">前往龙高校园墙</a>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <section id=\"features\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"row flex-column g-4\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <div class=\"card h-100 shadow\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                        <h2 class=\"card-title mt-3\">让校园墙再次伟大!</h2>\r\n                        <p class=\"card-text\">更适合龙高宝宝体质的校园墙</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <div class=\"card h-100 shadow\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-speedometer2 display-4 text-primary\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"card-title mt-3\">即刻发表</h3>\r\n                                <p class=\"card-text\">只需一步，轻松完成发言！无需等待，快速分享你的心声。</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <div class=\"card h-100 shadow\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-heart-fill display-4 text-danger\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"text-center\">wall.long-gao.com</h3>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"card-title mt-3\">一个网址，随时访问</h3>\r\n                                <p class=\"card-text\">无论何时何地，只需记住一个网址，即可随时随地访问校园墙，分享你的故事。</p>  \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <div class=\"card h-100 shadow\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-bar-chart-line display-4 text-success\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"card-title mt-3\">发出你的第一条消息</h3>\r\n                                <p class=\"card-text\">在这里，你可以随意表达自己的想法，分享你的故事。无论是文字还是文件，我们都支持！</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <div class=\"input-form\">\r\n                                    <form id=\"input-form\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); handleFormSubmit();\">\r\n                                        <textarea name=\"text\" placeholder=\"想说什么就说什么...\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;resize: none;\"></textarea>\r\n                                        <div class=\"d-flex flex-nowrap g-3 mb-2\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"flex-fill\">\r\n                                                <button type=\"submit\" id=\"submit-button\" class=\"w-100 btn btn-success\">提交</button>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </form>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <div class=\"card h-100 shadow\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-bar-chart-line display-4 text-success\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"row g-4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"card-title mt-3\">关于本站</h3>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n                                <p>本站由龙高一名学生搭建，旨在为同学们提供一个快捷自由表达的平台。</p>\r\n                                <p>原qq校园墙:3640057926</p>\r\n                                <p>网站已全部开源至<a href=\"https://github.com/renzhen666666/campusWall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>，欢迎star!</p>\r\n                                <p>联系站长: <a href=\"mailto:w-rz@outlook.com\">w-rz@outlook.com</a></p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <section id=\"messages\" class=\"py-5\"  data-aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">热门留言精选</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"row g-4\" id=\"hot-messages-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\" id=\"loading-hot-messages\"> \r\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n                    <div class=\"spinner-border\" role=\"status\">\r\n                        <span class=\"visually-hidden\">加载中...</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n</main>\r\n\r\n\r\n<footer class=\"bg-dark text-light py-5\">\r\n    <div class=\"container text-center\">\r\n        <p class=\"mb-4\">&copy; 2025 龙华*高级中学校园墙</p>\r\n        <div class=\"social-links\">\r\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-light me-3\"><i class=\"bi bi-twitter\"></i></a>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-light me-3\"><i class=\"bi bi-facebook\"></i></a>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-light\"><i class=\"bi bi-instagram\"></i></a>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</footer>\r\n",
    "config": {
      "title": "龙华*高级中学校园墙 (゜-゜)つロ 干杯~",
